+Major product-story chapters must not feel attached or mechanically stacked. Measure the previous visible media edge to the next visible chapter start, including any inset or internal entry space, and inspect both together in real viewport screenshots. CSS spacing tokens alone do not establish acceptance; the pause must be visible without producing excessive dead space.
